<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Brilliant Digital prices at $5.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Brilliant Digital prices at $5.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	Brilliant Digital Entertainment Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $5</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $5 - $6</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		CS First Boston</p>
<p>NOTE: The estimated price was reduced from a range of $11.50 to $13.50 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposed symbol &quot;BRIL&quot; on the Nasdaq National Market was changed to &quot;BDE&quot; on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
